-- KAN-65: fields, lot layouts and lots on PostGIS.
-- Geometry is MultiPolygon in EPSG:4326, always written through the repositories (normalized:
-- ST_Multi, ST_Force2D, RFC 7946 ring order, 7-decimal precision). Hectares are geodesic and
-- generated by the database; declaredHectares is the optional cadastral area typed by hand.
-- fields / field_lots / campaigns.fieldId had no data yet (CouchDB is still the source; the
-- importer fills these tables), so they are recreated instead of migrated row by row.
-- References from stock, exits, crop movements, deposits, productive units and expenses are
-- RESTRICT: a field or lot with references is archived, never deleted (nor nulled silently).
-- NOTE: CREATE EXTENSION needs a superuser (rds_superuser on RDS) in staging/production.

-- CreateExtension
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "postgis";

